{"id":"4aec613831b7dd67","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-tangent.md","title":"Tangent","display":"df-tangent — Tangent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tangent","aliases":["58-df-tangent","Tangent Space","Tangent Vector"],"display":"df-tangent — Tangent","depends_on":["[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tangent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tangent</span><span>Tangent Space</span><span>Tangent Vector</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tangent — Tangent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"58-df-smooth-manifold\">58-df-smooth-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p\\in V\">\\(D,T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\\)</span> 使用内部光滑流形定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\)</span> 使用内部光滑映射文件中的显式集合构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 是集合函数谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\)</span> 固定流形结构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentVector}_S(D,M,p,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentVector}_S(D,M,p,n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p,n)\\)</span> 保留原来的存在结构式接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\">\\(T_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> 为下式定义的记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}vector\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land p\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(D,C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R),\\mathbb R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\nD(\\{\\langle x,af(x)+bg(x)\\rangle:x\\in M\\})=aD(f)+bD(g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\;\nD(\\{\\langle x,f(x)g(x)\\rangle:x\\in M\\})=D(f)g(p)+f(p)D(g).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}vector\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land p\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(D,C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R),\\mathbb R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\nD(\\{\\langle x,af(x)+bg(x)\\rangle:x\\in M\\})=aD(f)+bD(g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\;\nD(\\{\\langle x,f(x)g(x)\\rangle:x\\in M\\})=D(f)g(p)+f(p)D(g).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land p\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land T=\\{D\\in\\mathbb R^{C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)}:\n\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land p\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land T=\\{D\\in\\mathbb R^{C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)}:\n\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}vector}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentVector}_S(D,M,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}vector}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentVector}_S(D,M,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\nT_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\n\\{D\\in\\mathbb R^{C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)}:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\nT_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\n\\{D\\in\\mathbb R^{C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)}:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>切向量仍是给定光滑函数代数上的实线性 Leibniz 导子。光滑函数代数与逐点运算均已明确，不再使用未定义的元语言构造。</li>\n<li>结构版切空间关系先要求合法流形结构和点，不再让非法结构因空集合推导式而被错误接受。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Warner, Foundations of Differentiable Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-smooth-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentVector}_S(D,M,p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"T_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}vector\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land p\\in M\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(D,C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R),\\mathbb R\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f,g\\in C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\nD(\\{\\langle x,af(x)+bg(x)\\rangle:x\\in M\\})=aD(f)+bD(g)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f,g\\in C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\;\nD(\\{\\langle x,f(x)g(x)\\rangle:x\\in M\\})=D(f)g(p)+f(p)D(g).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land p\\in M\\\\\n&\\land T=\\{D\\in\\mathbb R^{C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)}:\n\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}vector}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentVector}_S(D,M,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T,M,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TangentSpaceStructure}_S(T,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}space\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\nT_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\n\\{D\\in\\mathbb R^{C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)}:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\;\\mathrm{TangentVectorStructure}_S(D,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,p,n)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2939,"backlinks":[{"id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8e70eff045618bab","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T_pM=T_p(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M)$、$T_qN=T_q(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N)$ 使用 [[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]] 的导子集合。对于同一定义域 $A$ 上的实值函数，$(av+bw)(h)=a\\,v(h)+b\\,w(h)$，逐点和及数乘均为由此确定的函数图。"},{"id":"becb68cbe0f3a15e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$（四元上游谓词；see [[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]）"},{"id":"8a29fc853b841c25","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md|58-df-tangent]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["71fe0dc4c8613e69","36d7463d215be751","d87c5d842ade903d"]}